%SIXMD 1
# @?YES - REPEAT A STRING

## DESCRIPTION

REPEATS STRING, OR Y BY DEFAULT, UNTIL INTERRUPTED.

USAGE IS 'YES [STRING]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/YES
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/YES.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

